                        2076 --766: /*!****************************************************************************************************************//**
                        2077 --767:  * \ingroup     PKCDCommonAPIsInternal
                        2078 --768:  * \brief       Calculates modular inversion with Fermat's little theorem
                        2079 --769:  * \param       [in] p_wk_A            An address of work area which contains a value <br>
                        2080 --770:  *                                     which modular inverse is to be calculated. The value must be aligned with bottom.
                        2081 --771:  * \param       [in] p_wk_mod          An address of work area which contains a modulus. <br>
                        2082 --772:  *                                     The value must be aligned with bottom.
