                        2087 --777:  * \return
                        2088 --778:  *  - #PKCD_RET_OK:                  Successfully done.
                        2089 --779:  *  - #PKCD_RET_INTERNALERR:         Internal processing failed.
                        2090 --780:  *  - #PKCD_RET_PKCCTIMEOUTERR:      PKCC operation timeouted.
                        2091 --781:  *  - #PKCD_RET_PKCCERR:             An error occurred while the PKCC operations.
                        2092 --782:  * \par Security components
                        2093 --783:  *  - No
                        2094 --784:  * \par Global Variables
                        2095 --785:  *  - None
                        2096 --786:  * \par Registers Used
                        2097 --787:  *  - #PKCD_CMN_ICUM_PKCCB0DPA, #PKCD_CMN_ICUM_PKCCB0DPB, #PKCD_CMN_ICUM_PKCCB0DPC, <br>
                        2098 --788:  *    #PKCD_CMN_ICUM_PKCCB0DPS, #PKCD_CMN_ICUM_PKCCB0STC, #PKCD_CMN_ICUM_PKCCB0OMR, <br>
