                        2877 --1056:  *  - #PKCD_RET_OK:                  Successfully done.
                        2878 --1057:  *  - #PKCD_RET_PKCCTIMEOUTERR:      PKCC operation timeouted.
                        2879 --1058:  *  - #PKCD_RET_PKCCERR:             An error occurred while the PKCC operations.
